**Test filters.** For this step these gates run only the tests their filter selects (plus any inherited expected-red tests); put the tests this step adds or changes where a filter value finds them:
- `constructor-unit-tests`: 

**How to implement.** A seed list that holds no library value goes first: `Experiments.seedExperiments` (`Experiments.fs:seedExperiments`), the dark-line template that `createInMemoryExperiments` closes over (the S1.7 brief names it; .spec-md §3.3: every other seed value is deleted). It holds no library value, and no product code reads `listExperiments` or `tryGetExperiment`: the Experiments bay builds experiments against the scene. (1) `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Experiments.fs`: `seedExperiments` and its doc are deleted; `createInMemoryExperiments ()` keeps its signature and answers `Ok []` from `listExperiments` and `Ok None` from `tryGetExperiment`; its doc says, in one to three lines, that the in-memory proxy holds no experiment (spec 0050 S1.7). (2) `OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs`: `listExperiments returns at least one seed template` and `tryGetExperiment hits a known seed id and misses an unknown one` assert the deleted seed, so they are deleted, and `the in-memory experiments proxy lists no experiment` (`listExperiments ()` is `Ok []`) and `the in-memory experiments proxy resolves no experiment id` (`tryGetExperiment` of `ExperimentId 1` and of `ExperimentId 9999` is `Ok None`) take their place, so the class's count is unchanged. (3) `OpticalConstructor.Tests/OutOfBandDiagnosticTests.fs`: the fact reading `seedExperiments |> List.head` builds its dark line as a test-local `Experiment` with the deleted seed's fields (`ExperimentId 1`, an empty setup, `varied = None`, `CaptureTransmitted`, `VariableRange.forVariable VaryR1`, no data file, no source wavelength), and its assertions are unchanged.

**Acceptance.** After the deletion, `git grep -n -F "seedExperiments" -- Berreman/` MUST find nothing; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass with its count unchanged, including `the in-memory experiments proxy lists no experiment` and `the in-memory experiments proxy resolves no experiment id`; and build, elevation and the seven s07 invariants MUST pass.
